<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 586.16, down 2.00.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 328 to 204.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.04.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 18,564,165 compared with 21,013,650 Friday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
